-/-- **Acceptance, side 2**: `Δ ⊨ ¬σ(c)` upgrades to `Δ ⊨ ¬∃x σ(x)` when `c_j` is fresh for
-`Δ`. -/
-theorem entails_not_genEx_of_entails_not
-    (hfresh : ∀ δ ∈ Δ, j ∉ sentenceJConsts (L' := L) (J := ℕ) δ)
