-agree everywhere). -/
-noncomputable def agreeCap (F G : Z → ExtOrd) : ExtOrd :=
-  (Finset.univ.filter fun z => F z ≠ G z).inf fun z => min (F z) (G z)
-
-/-! ## Level caps -/
-
-/-- The **level cap** between two capped labellings: the agreement cap, capped by both caps,
