-/-- **`ψ` is strictly monotone on the grade-one keys of values of `S₂` with finite part `≥ 1`.** -/
-theorem psi_lt_psi {u u' : Ordinal.{0}} (hu : 1 ≤ finitePart u) (hu' : 1 ≤ finitePart u')
